sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as React app
  participant API as Express API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant R as Redis / BullMQ
  participant W as Worker
  participant S as Ethereal SMTP

  U->>FE: Upload CSV, write template, Send Later
  FE->>API: POST /api/emails/schedule
  API->>API: validate (zod), dedupe leads, render {{variables}} per lead
  API->>PG: INSERT campaign + N emails (one UNNEST statement, one transaction)
  API->>R: addBulk(N delayed jobs, jobId = email-<uuid>, delay = sendAt - now)
  API-->>FE: 201 { scheduled: N, firstSendAt, lastSendAt }
  Note over R: Jobs sleep in Redis' delayed set (no cron, no polling)
  R->>W: job becomes due
  W->>PG: load email (skip if already sent/failed)
  W->>R: Lua reserveSendSlot(sender, campaign)
  alt hour is full
    R-->>W: LIMITED, retry at next window
    W->>PG: status = rate_limited, next_attempt_at
    W->>R: moveToDelayed(next hour + seq * 25ms)
  else slot is in the future (min gap)
    R-->>W: RESERVED at T
    W->>R: moveToDelayed(T), keep the reservation in job data
  else slot is now
    W->>PG: UPDATE status='sending' WHERE status IN (scheduled, rate_limited)
    W->>S: SMTP send (deterministic Message-ID)
    W->>PG: status = sent, sent_at, message_id, preview_url, processed_by
  end
  FE->>API: poll every 5 s
  API-->>FE: updated lists, counts and campaign progress
